@startuml Epic-B State Diagram
!theme plain
title Epic B: 球隊/球員資料管理 - State Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FEFEFE
  BorderColor #333333
}

' Team State Diagram
state "Team Status" as TeamStatus {
  [*] --> ACTIVE : CreateTeam

  ACTIVE : 球隊正常運作中
  ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : UpdateTeam
  ACTIVE --> DELETED : DeleteTeam\n(軟刪除)

  DELETED : 球隊已刪除
  DELETED --> [*]

  note right of DELETED
    根據邊界決策 Q2:
    刪除時標記為 DELETED
    而非硬刪除
  end note
}

' Player State Diagram
state "Player Status" as PlayerStatus {
  [*] --> ACTIVE : CreatePlayer

  ACTIVE : 球員正常狀態
  ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : UpdatePlayer
  ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : UpdatePlayerOrder
  ACTIVE --> DELETED : DeletePlayer\n(軟刪除)
  ACTIVE --> DELETED : Team DeleteTeam\n(級聯刪除)

  DELETED : 球員已刪除
  DELETED --> [*]

  note right of DELETED
    根據邊界決策 Q3:
    當球隊刪除時
    所有球員級聯刪除
  end note
}

' Legend
legend right
  |= 決策 |= 說明 |
  | Q2 | 軟刪除：標記 status 為 DELETED |
  | Q3 | 級聯刪除：刪除球隊時一併刪除球員 |
endlegend

@enduml
